</script><div id="content"><div class="container-fluid"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between flex-wrap flex-md-nowrap align-items-center pt-4 px-3"><h3 class="mb-0">Tournament Pairings</h3><h4 class="mb-0">2027 Frankfurt Pokémon VGC Regional Championships</h4></div><div class="d-flex justify-content-end"><h5 class="my-0 px-3">September 26, 2026 at 08:30<br><small><span class="badge badge-light">Time zone: Europe/Berlin CEST</span></small></h5></div><hr><div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row justify-content-between pt-2 px-3" style="gap: 0.75rem;"><div><div>Last uploaded: 6 days ago — 1173 players</div><div>Tables Remaining: <span id="pending"></span></div></div><div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-start" style="gap: 0.5rem;"><button id="hide" class="btn btn-info">Show Only Incomplete</button></div></div><div class="pt-2 px-3"><ul class="nav nav-pills" role="tablist"><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link active" id="P2-tab" data-toggle="tab" href="#P2" role="tab" aria-controls="P2" aria-selected="false">Masters in Round 17</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link " id="P1-tab" data-toggle="tab" href="#P1" role="tab" aria-controls="P1" aria-selected="false">Senior in Round 8</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link " id="P0-tab" data-toggle="tab" href="#P0" role="tab" aria-controls="P0" aria-selected="true">Junior in Round 6</a></li></ul></div><div id="tables" class="tab-content pt-2 px-3"><div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="P2" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="P2-tab"><div class="pt-2 px-3"><ul class="nav nav-tabs" role="tablist"><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link " id="P2R1-tab" data-toggle="tab" href="#P2R1" role="tab" aria-controls="P2R1" aria-selected="false" title="updated 2026-10-03 at 21:20:42">R1</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link " id="P2R2-tab" data-toggle="tab" href="#P2R2" role="tab" aria-controls="P2R2" aria-selected="false" title="updated 2026-10-03 at 21:20:42">R2</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a cl